    "2118179 on Ascended) where it dies. Mar'li (14510) Infests 15 s into her spider form, hatching the nearest",
    "free egg (179985) as a Spawn of Mar'li (15041, an estimated stand-in). A Mythic and an Ascended hero each",
    "fight one Mar'li alone; the world's eggs share phase 1 and the fixture lives in the lane's own phase, so",
    "each hero places one untimed egg once the first Hatch Eggs (2118115, 17 s, then every 30 s) has passed and",
    "her spider form has begun. Infest then has the egg before the second Hatch Eggs at 47 s; on Mythic the",
    "egg stays free until that Hatch Eggs hatches it."
